        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>问题解决</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    background: #fff;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 18px 26px;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    position: relative;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    background: #f4f4f4;\n    border: 1px dashed #aaa;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  /* header */\n  .header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n  }\n  .header .deco {\n    width: 92px;\n    height: 34px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n  }\n  .header .title {\n    border: 1px solid #8a4fa8;\n    color: #7b2fa0;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    padding: 3px 16px;\n  }\n  /* problem lines */\n  .prob-line {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin: 6px 0;\n  }\n  .badge {\n    width: 20px; height: 20px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: #e2312a;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    flex: none;\n  }\n  .q-text { font-size: 14px; }\n  .red { color: #d0111b; }\n  .blue { color: #1552a0; }\n  .green { color: #0f7a34; }\n  .purple { color: #7b2fa0; }\n  .arrow { color: #d0111b; }\n  .box-red {\n    border: 1px solid #d0111b;\n    color: #d0111b;\n    padding: 1px 6px;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .scene {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 96px;\n    margin: 4px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .row { display: flex; align-items: center; }\n  .bubble-left, .bubble-right {\n    border: 1px solid #9bd3ea;\n    background: #f2fbfe;\n    border-radius: 12px;\n    padding: 5px 8px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .kid {\n    width: 56px;\n    height: 70px;\n    flex: none;\n  }\n  .center-col {\n    flex: 1;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .segbar {\n    width: 250px;\n    height: 16px;\n    border: 1px solid #333;\n    margin: 2px auto;\n  }\n  .calc { margin: 5px 0 0 96px; }\n  .ans { margin: 4px 0 0 96px; }\n  .note-small { font-size: 10.5px; color: #d0111b; }\n  .yiyi {\n    border: 1px solid #d0111b;\n    color: #d0111b;\n    padding: 1px 6px;\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .grid-fig {\n    width: 190px;\n    height: 108px;\n  }\n  .footer-note {\n    margin-top: 14px;\n    font-size: 10.5px;\n    color: #d0111b;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n  .page-num {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 20px;\n    bottom: 6px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n  }\n  .panda {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 22px;\n    bottom: 26px;\n    width: 46px;\n    height: 30px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <div class=\"placeholder deco\">[装饰图形: 紫色菱形]</div>\n  <div class=\"title\">问题解决</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"prob-line\">\n  <span class=\"badge\">1</span>\n  <span class=\"q-text\">汽车已经行了多少千米？</span>\n  <span class=\"red\">求一个数的几分之几的问题</span>\n  <span class=\"arrow\">➡</span>\n  <span class=\"box-red\">用已知量乘分率</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"placeholder scene\">[情景插图: 山路上的公交车, 图中含文字标注 \"已经行了全程的 $\\frac{2}{3}$\"（右上）与 \"要行84千米\"（左下）]</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center; margin: 2px 0 8px 0;\">\n  <span class=\"red\">\"行了全程的 $\\frac{2}{3}$\"</span> 就是把全程看作单位\"1\"，已经行了的路程是 <span class=\"blue\">84km 的 $\\frac{2}{3}$</span>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <div class=\"bubble-left\" style=\"width:112px;\">\n    怎么理解\"已经行<br>了全程的 $\\frac{2}{3}$\"？\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"center-col\">\n    <div>行了全程的 $\\frac{2}{3}$</div>\n    <div class=\"segbar\"></div>\n    <div>全程84km</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"bubble-right\" style=\"width:112px;\">\n    把全程平均分成3<br>份，已经行了2份。\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;\">\n  <div class=\"placeholder kid\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">[人物: 女孩]</div>\n  <div style=\"flex:1;\">\n    <div class=\"calc\">可以这样算：$84 \\div 3 \\times 2 = 56(\\mathrm{km})$</div>\n    <div class=\"calc\">也可以这样算：$84 \\times \\frac{2}{3} = \\overset{28}{84} \\times \\frac{2}{3} = 56(\\mathrm{km})$</div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"placeholder kid\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">[人物: 男孩]</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"ans\">答：汽车已经行了56km。</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:right; font-size:10.5px; margin-top:2px;\">\n  当分数用来表示单位\"1\"的几分之几时，也可以叫做\"分率\"。<br>\n  单位\"1\"×分率=几分之几对应的量\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n  <span class=\"yiyi\">议一议</span>\n  <span style=\"margin-left:6px;\">\"$84 \\times \\frac{2}{3}$\"这样列式，你是怎么想的？</span>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"red\">求一个数的几分之几是多少。</div>\n\n<div class=\"prob-line\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;\">\n  <span class=\"badge\">2</span>\n  <span class=\"q-text\">张伯伯种了20hm²土地，其中 $\\frac{3}{4}$ 米种玫瑰，其中种红玫瑰的面积占玫瑰地面<br>积的 $\\frac{3}{5}$。张伯伯种了多少公顷红玫瑰？</span>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:right; margin-top:-4px;\">\n  <div class=\"red\">连续求一个数的几分之几的问题</div>\n  <div class=\"box-red\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">用已知量连续乘分率</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start; margin-top:8px;\">\n  <div style=\"width:118px;\">\n    <div class=\"bubble-left\">\n      题中的 $\\frac{3}{4}$ 表示什<br>么意思？$\\frac{3}{5}$ 呢？\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:6px; font-size:10.5px;\">\n      <span class=\"green\">$\\frac{3}{4}$</span> 表示把 <span class=\"blue\">20 hm² 土地</span><br>\n      看作单位\"1\"，其中<br>\n      的 $\\frac{3}{4}$ 种玫瑰。\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"margin-top:10px; font-size:10.5px;\">\n      <span class=\"green\">$\\frac{3}{5}$</span><br>\n      表示把种玫瑰的土地看作单位\"1\"，其中的\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:center;\">\n    <div>20hm²土地</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder grid-fig\" style=\"margin:2px auto;\">[图示: 长方形方格图, 部分区域涂色表示玫瑰地与红玫瑰]</div>\n    <div>玫瑰地的 $\\frac{3}{5}$ 种红玫瑰</div>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"width:120px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;\">20hm²土地的 $\\frac{3}{4}$ 种玫瑰</div>\n    <div class=\"bubble-right\" style=\"margin-top:22px;\">还可以怎样解决？</div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder kid\" style=\"margin:6px auto 0 auto;\">[人物: 女孩]</div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;\">\n  <div class=\"placeholder kid\">[人物: 男孩]</div>\n  <div style=\"flex:1; text-align:center;\">\n    $20 \\times \\frac{3}{4} \\times \\frac{3}{5} = 9(\\mathrm{hm}^2)$\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"width:56px;\"></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center; margin-top:4px;\">答：张伯伯种了9hm²红玫瑰。</div>\n\n<div class=\"footer-note\">\n  <strong>注意：</strong>分数连乘问题中最基本的数量关系：单位\"1\"的量×分率=分率的对应量。准确地找出单位<br>\n  \"1\"的关键在于理解题目中\"哪个量是（或占，相当于）哪个量的几分之几\"，是哪个量的几分之几，<br>\n  那个量就是单位\"1\"。\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"placeholder panda\">[插图: 熊猫]</div>\n<div class=\"page-num\">7</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
